<article class="env-lemma" id="05Z9">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05Z9">Lemma <span data-tag="05Z9">76.7.9</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. If $X \to Y$ is an immersion of algebraic spaces over $S$ then $\Omega _{X/S}$ is zero. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from the schemes version, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01UY" data-tag="01UY">29.33.14</a>, of this result via étale localization, see Lemma <a href="/tag/04CU" data-tag="04CU">76.7.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>